{
 "_note": "The curated layer of the template spec.\n\nGeometry comes straight from Canva's own JSON in canva/. What Canva cannot tell us is editorial: which replaceable frames are real customer photo slots (as opposed to the stock art that is also technically replaceable), which text a customer writes, and what each page is called. That judgement was made by comparing the blank template against the filled magazine page by page, and it is what this file preserves. It was lifted out of the hand-transcribed spec that preceded canva/, which is why the wording of the placeholders is editorial rather than Canva's sample copy (that is kept alongside as source_text).",
